  m_text: 'The Mad Hatters


    orion, apolo, and armstrong are the three sons of
    Jackson, and they love to make music. armstrong is the one that plays the saxadpone,
    while orion and apolo play the bass and guitar, together they make the mad hatters.

    (copyright)'
