  m_text: 'Circus Sally


    circus sally is a japanese acrobatic that grew up in
    the circus,  but even though she loves performing in the circus, she always dreamed
    to be a vocaloid, so she left and ended up here at wonderland, with madam Paris
    she can finaly sing for everyone to here, even if jackson cant speak japanese.'
